  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large skillet over medium high heat.",
    "Add the chicken to the skillet and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, demerara sugar, garlic infused oil, and ginger to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Add the bell peppers and scallions to the skillet and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Season the stir fry with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stir fry hot over rice or with some roasted vegetables."
